# 030 = upstream PR #100135 (fixes #17929): try the user-configured fallback
#   chain BEFORE failing fast when no credentials resolve (agent/agent_init.py).
#   An exhausted single-entry pool (e.g. openrouter free-tier quota) now reaches
#   the fallback entries instead of dying at init with a misleading error;
#   explicitly-named providers without creds nor usable fallback still fail
#   fast with the env-var hint. No-op when no fallback_model is configured.
#   Upstream contributors/tests hunks excluded. Applies clean to v2026.8.31
#   (+028, different region of the same file, no conflict).
#   Drop when HERMES_AGENT_VERSION moves past the tag that includes #100135.
